SUMMARY:Live Music at The One Stop
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nLet's head to The One Stop for s
 ome live music with Kid Billy\, the solo project of Asheville multi‑inst
 rumentalist and singer‑songwriter Billy Litz (frontman of Hustle Souls).
  Kid Billy blends earnest songwriting with high‑energy live loops layeri
 ng trumpet\, piano\, guitar and harmonica. His sound draws from acoustic b
 lues\, trad‑jazz and indie‑folk and is both timeless and innovative. I
 f you purchase tickets ahead of time\, you can name your own price (as low
  as $5) – tickets may be more at the door. The show starts at 6:00 PM at
  The One Stop (21+). Hope to see you there!
